tent": "Asking for Things at the Supermarket"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you ask for things in a shop, you can say <span class=\"italic\">Excuse me ...</span> to get a salesperson's attention."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Muhammad</span>:  How much are the apples? <br /><span class=\"strong\">Dominic</span>: The large apples are $4 a pound."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mateo</span>: How much are the oranges? <br /><span class=\"strong\">Declan</span>: They're $2.50 a kilo."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bentley</span>: How much are the pears?<br /><span class=\"strong\">Jake</span>:  They are $1.25 each"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"02\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking Where Things Are</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking How Much Things Cost</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Excuse me ... Where are the apples? <br />Where are the oranges?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How much are the apples? <br />How much are the pears?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The answer to a <span class=\"italic\"> Where </span>question is a place."}, {"type": "text", "content": " The answer to <span class=\"italic\"> How much?</span> is a price. It can also include a size and a weight.<br />"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"02\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Weights</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Sizes</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a kilogram <br />half a kilo <br />grams\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"small <br />medium <br />large\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing Likes and Dislikes"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can express likes and dislikes with different phrases. You can use words like <span class=\"italic\">because</span> , <span class=\"italic\"> also</span> and <span class=\"italic\"> too</span> when you express likes and dislikes. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"02\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Expressing Likes</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Expressing Dislikes</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Examples</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I like <br />I <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> also</span>  love\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't like \u2026 <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> because</span><br />I hate \u2026 <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> too</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I don't like fruit because it is sweet.<br /><span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Alice</span>: I hate apples! <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> <br />Ben</span>: I hate apples too!<br />I also love oranges!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "supermarket "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a very large food store"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They have apples at the supermarket."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you shop at a supermarket."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "grocery shopping "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to look for and buy food"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to go grocery shopping."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fruit "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a sweet food that grows on trees "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I prefer fresh fruit."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pound "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a unit of weight"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The apples cost $4 a pound."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "apple "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a hard round fruit that has red, green or yellow skin and is white inside "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This is a red apple."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "orange "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a round fruit that has orange skin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are oranges on sale."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pear "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a sweet fruit that has green or brown skin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I hate pears!"}, {"type": 